  "question": {
    "html": "<p>When the peak wavelength of the radiation emitted by a black body is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda\"></span>, its temperature is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T\"></span>, and the power radiated by the black body is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"P\"></span>. What is the temperature and the power radiated by the black body when the peak wavelength is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2\\lambda\"></span>?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Temperature</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Power radiated</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{T}{2}\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{P}{16}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2T\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{P}{16}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{T}{2}\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"16P\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2T\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"16P\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
